+ * geo_fac * lef * fac2 * mismatchflag dwmisn_33= - 0.00261377 * geo_fac * wef 
+ * fac2 * mismatchflag toxmisn_33=0.00261377 * geo_fac * toxn_33 * fac2 * mismatchflag 
+ tnoiax=1.273e5 / (l * 1e6) + 8.395e6 rnoiax=0.0353 / (l * 1e6) + 0.4701 
