subckt rppolyl ( n1 n2 ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u factor=1 pt=temp mf=1 mismatchflag=0 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(mf * l * factor 
+ * w * factor * 1e12) factmis=0.0113 * geo_fac * par_res * mismatchflag rsh=r_rppolyl 
+ * (1 + factmis) dw=-0.01549u pvc1=3.53e-07 pvc2=7.56e-12 ptc1=0.00230054 ptc2=-3.32e-06 
+ tfac=1.0 + ptc1 * (pt - 25.0) + ptc2 * (pt - 25.0) * (pt - 25.0) 
