+ ptc2=-5.37e-06 tfac=1.0 + ptc1 * (pt - 25.0) + ptc2 * (pt - 25.0) * (pt - 25.0) 
+ 
r1 ( n1 n2 ) bsource r=rsh / mf * l * factor / (w * factor - dw) * (1 + pvc1 * (abs(v(n2,n1)) 
+ / l / factor) + pvc2 * (v(n2,n1) / l / factor) * (v(n2,n1) / l / factor)) * tfac
