cab ( a b ) bsource q=(1+factmis)*(cc1 * edg * 1e-9 + cf * 1e-9 * fri1 + ca 
+ * 1e-9 * area + cc2 * 1e-9 * fri2) *  (1 + (temp - 25) * ( - 9 * 1e-6) 
+ + (temp - 25) * (temp - 25) * (3e-8)) * (v(a,b) - 4.92 * 1e-6 /2 * v(a,b)**2 + 1.21 * 1e-6 /3 * v(a,b)**3) *mf* rtmom_fac
cpa ( a p ) bsource q=(ca_p * (abm + afm) / (w * 1e6) * 1e-3 + cf_p 
+ * pf * 1e-9 + cc_p * pfb * 1e-9) * (1 + (temp - 25) * ( - 9 * 1e-6) 
