ca1b1 ( a1 b1 ) bsource q=(1+factmis)*(cc1 * edg * 1e-9 + cf * 1e-9 * fri1 + ca 
+ * 1e-9 * area + cc2 * 1e-9 * fri2) *  (1 + (temp - 25) * ( - 9 * 1e-6) 
