+ * lm1g / (wm1g + 0.18e-6)) + 0.5 + (wm1g + 0.18e-6) / (3 * lm1g)) / br lsm=1e-9 
+ * 2 * lm1s * (log(2 * lm1s / (wm1s + 0.18e-6)) + 0.5 + (wm1s + 0.18e-6) / (3 * 
+ lm1s)) / (br + 1) ww=wr * factor * gr + 2.30e-07 * (gr - 1) ll=lr * factor * br 
+ + (br - 1) * 3.10e-7 + 2 * 2.30e-7 wtub=ww + 2 * 3.6e-7 ltub=ll + 2 * 3.6e-7 area_dio=wtub 
+ * ltub pj_dio=2 * (wtub + ltub) rwsti=554 * 3e-6 / ll rwod=315 * ww / 6 / ll rlsti=554 
