+ - 1) * (mismatchflag - 2) / (3 - 0) / (3 - 1) / (3 - 2) * (0.006082)) geo_fac=1 
+ / sqrt(lt * wt * 1e12) factmis=mis * geo_fac * par_rfmim ltop_para=((0.24 * (wt 
